      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DELIGHTFUL RAIN (2) turned in a plain performance last time when fifth at Traralgon over 350m behind Frida Science (20.82) in a T3 Grade 7. Can bounce back. POPPER (1) was never in contention last time after settling off pace at Traralgon, but prior to that won by 2.25 lengths at Sale (24.72) beating Be My Tiger in a Maiden on July 1. The form from her last run stacks up well. Leading chance. WE CAN (4) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 1.4 lengths win at Healesville in a handy 16.99. Jumping from the pinch draw but has the ability and in winning form. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Form should stack up. MINTER BOOST (8) can measure up with the right run.",
